s 2026 meilleurs remboursements\",\"width\":800,\"height\":450,\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"100%\",\"objectFit\":\"contain\",\"maxHeight\":\"450px\"},\"priority\":true}]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{}]\n12:[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{}]\n1f:T13c0,<p>\n<h2>Les meilleurs cashbacks iGraal de la semaine</h2><p><strong>iGraal</strong>, le n°1 du cashback en France, propose chaque semaine des taux boostés sur des centaines de boutiques. Voici notre sélection des <strong>meilleures offres</strong> de la semaine du 10 mars 2026.</p><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://fr.igraal.com/parrainage?parrain=AG_66d33e65091a1&utm_medium=raf&utm_source=refer_friend\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">S'inscrire sur iGraal (15€ offerts) <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Top Cashback de la semaine</h2><h3>High-tech & Gaming</h3><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Boutique</th><th>Cashback</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Sony</strong></td>\n<td><strong>20%</strong> + code promo -10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Dell</strong></td>\n<td><strong>12%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Acer</strong></td>\n<td><strong>10%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Samsung</strong></td>\n<td><strong>10%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><h3>Électroménager</h3><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Boutique</th><th>Cashback</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Whirlpool</strong></td>\n<td><strong>16%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Electrolux</strong></td>\n<td><strong>13%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>LG</strong></td>\n<td><strong>12%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><h3>Shopping & Mode</h3><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Boutique</th><th>Cashback</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Temu</strong></td>\n<td><strong>14%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Zalando</strong></td>\n<td>Cashback + codes promo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>La Redoute</strong></td>\n<td>Cashback actif</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><h3>Beauté & Santé</h3><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Boutique</th><th>Cashback</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Yves Rocher</strong></td>\n<td>Cashback actif</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Sephora</strong></td>\n<td>Cashback actif</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Marionnaud</strong></td>\n<td>Cashback actif</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p><div id=\"ezoic-pub-ad-placeholder-203\" class=\"ad-container\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"></div><h2>Pourquoi iGraal</h2><ul><li>💰 <strong>N°1 en France</strong> : la plus grande plateforme de cashback</li>\n<li>🎁 <strong>15€ offerts</strong> à l'inscription</li>\n<li>🏪 <strong>1 500+ boutiques</strong> : Sony, Fnac, Booking, Zalando, Sephora…</li>\n<li>🔄 <strong>Cashback + codes promo</strong> : cumul possible</li>\n<li>📱 <strong>Extension navigateur</strong> : cashback automatique sans y penser</li>\n<li>🏦 <strong>Retrait facile</strong> : virement bancaire dès 20€</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://fr.igraal.com/parrainage?parrain=AG_66d33e65091a1&utm_medium=raf&utm_source=refer_friend\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">S'inscrire sur iGraal (15€ offerts) <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap